OL,3,GNEWSAMum wants people to know 'there is
OL,4,Ahope after pregnancy loss'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who welcomed a daughter after
OL,7,Ftwo pregnancy losses has said she wants
OL,8,Fothers who face similar heartache to
OL,9,Fknow "there is still hope".
OL,11,FHayley Metcalfe, 37, from Runcorn in
OL,12,FCheshire, said she and her husband Mike
OL,13,Fwere "over the moon" to find out she
OL,14,Fwas pregnant with her second son in
OL,15,F2023.
OL,17,FBut what followed was three years of
OL,18,Fheartbreak when Hayley suffered a
OL,19,Fplacental abruption at 19 weeks
OL,20,Fpregnant and was told her baby boy, who
OL,21,Fthey had named Oscar, had died.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
